--PRACTICE
-- GENERATED by tools/classless-web/practicegen.py -- regenerate, do not hand-edit.
--
-- CLDB.casts[rankId] = presses of that RANK an average fight contains,
-- derived from its cooldown, cast time and aura duration in Spell.dbc for a
-- 20-second fight.
--
-- Server.lua divides PRACTICE_CHANCE by this to get a per-cast chance, so every
-- ability advances at the same rate per FIGHT however often it is pressed --
-- and pressing one more than expected pays less each time, because the kill
-- resolves 1 - (1 - chance) ^ (casts actually made) and that saturates.
--
-- Keyed by RANK, not by line: a nuke's cast time grows with its rank (Fireball
-- 1.5s at rank 1, 3.5s at rank 16) and pricing the whole chain off rank 1 paid a
-- caster 5/12 of what an instant of the same tier earned. Server.lua reads the
-- highest rank the character owns.
--
-- 2069 ranks. Anything absent is passive or unknown to the DBC; Server.lua falls
-- back to the line's own entry and then to PRACTICE_CASTS.
if CLDB==nil then CLDB={} end
CLDB.casts={
